  "details": "When tabbed out of VRChat (Irregardless of how it was done, tab, windows key, etc.) the cursor will remain active on screen at all times. If this is a intended feature, it would be greatly displeasing for streaming type content. This only started with the new UI update, so I'd assume it has something to do with the new HUD elements (Specifically on Desktop).",
